WEBVTT

01:30.340 --> 01:33.578
=Against The Current=

01:33.579 --> 01:35.000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

01:35.180 --> 01:36.920
=Episode 12=
(This drama does not correspond)

01:36.930 --> 01:38.200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

01:38.210 --> 01:41.110
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

01:41.640 --> 01:42.480
Old Master.

01:43.560 --> 01:45.640
What if Young Master wasn't the only one

01:45.640 --> 01:47.040
wearing a larkspur flower ornament?

01:47.560 --> 01:49.200
If you and Master Lin

01:49.430 --> 01:50.920
also wore larkspur flower ornaments,

01:50.930 --> 01:52.120
or even if all the male guests

01:52.120 --> 01:53.680
wore larkspur flower ornaments,

01:53.790 --> 01:55.310
then even if Young Master wore one,

01:56.120 --> 01:57.920
it wouldn't imply
any romantic involvement.

01:58.680 --> 01:59.790
We've already sent people

02:00.000 --> 02:02.200
to find clever women
skilled with their hands

02:02.200 --> 02:04.480
to learn how to make
larkspur flower ornaments.

02:05.310 --> 02:06.480
But on such short notice,

02:06.920 --> 02:09.310
there's no telling
if they can even make them,

02:09.630 --> 02:11.590
let alone make so many.

02:13.870 --> 02:14.800
I think

02:15.360 --> 02:16.120
Luxue Lodge

02:16.120 --> 02:18.648
should still have some finished
larkspur flower ornaments.

02:19.400 --> 02:21.520
Young Lady Du would never do anything

02:21.520 --> 02:24.344
as improper as privately
exchanging gifts without a matchmaker.

02:25.110 --> 02:26.888
She must have made
too many flower ornaments

02:26.920 --> 02:28.510
and accidentally, in all the confusion,

02:28.520 --> 02:30.952
mixed one in with the festive
ornaments for Young Master.

02:33.000 --> 02:35.190
I was only making a desperate attempt,

02:35.310 --> 02:36.590
taking a chance on my guess.

02:37.520 --> 02:38.800
Fortunately, I asked Xiaolian,

02:38.840 --> 02:42.232
and Young Lady Du really did have more
larkspur flower ornaments in her room.

02:47.240 --> 02:48.750
Yuchan said you enjoy reading.

02:49.176 --> 02:50.920
From now on,
the books in the Inner Study,

02:50.984 --> 02:52.680
except those locked away in the chests,

02:53.120 --> 02:53.960
all the others

02:54.568 --> 02:56.536
are yours to borrow whenever you like.

02:57.240 --> 02:58.360
Thank you, Young Master.

03:04.870 --> 03:05.750
What you did today

03:06.630 --> 03:07.910
was both brave and resourceful.

03:07.928 --> 03:09.780
You handled everything
swiftly and thoroughly.

03:09.840 --> 03:11.160
You deserve a generous reward.

03:12.030 --> 03:12.840
What would you like?

03:13.896 --> 03:16.280
First Madam already rewarded me
with ten taels of gold.

03:16.960 --> 03:19.470
I'd like a day off to go home
and spend time with my parents,

03:19.870 --> 03:21.750
and ask Uncle Liu to make the slingshot.

03:27.430 --> 03:30.150
And I'd also like
to ask Young Master for something.

03:34.310 --> 03:34.710
Go ahead.

03:34.872 --> 03:36.152
What would you like?

03:38.168 --> 03:40.590
I heard the ointment used
in the army for treating chilblains

03:40.800 --> 03:43.190
works much better
than the ones sold at pharmacies.

03:43.630 --> 03:44.560
I'd like some.

03:47.430 --> 03:49.150
My mother has chilblains on her hands.

03:55.560 --> 03:56.190
All right.

03:57.280 --> 03:58.560
I'll have Nanke get you a bottle.

04:00.568 --> 04:01.630
Thank you, Young Master.

04:06.680 --> 04:08.710
Lingdang can help
apply the medicine for me.

04:08.910 --> 04:10.360
How could I trouble you, Young Lady?

04:11.000 --> 04:12.630
I'm the one who studied medicine,

04:13.910 --> 04:15.080
not Lingdang.

04:17.680 --> 04:18.830
They struck you so hard.

04:19.120 --> 04:21.000
Even with the good medicine
Nanny Wu sent,

04:21.720 --> 04:22.920
it'll still leave a scar.

04:25.430 --> 04:26.920
You were foolish, too.

04:27.720 --> 04:28.920
Twenty strikes with the ruler.

04:29.430 --> 04:30.870
If you'd taken ten on each hand

04:31.240 --> 04:32.870
and split the punishment between them,

04:33.040 --> 04:34.920
your injury wouldn't be this severe.

04:36.360 --> 04:38.920
Yuchan said we
still had duties to attend to,

04:39.320 --> 04:41.480
so she begged Nanny Wu
to strike only our left hand.

04:41.870 --> 04:43.600
We needed the right hand
to keep working.

04:52.040 --> 04:54.510
You're part of Luxue Lodge now.

04:55.120 --> 04:56.160
You have to listen to me.

04:56.920 --> 05:00.240
You need to rest properly
for the next few days.

05:02.430 --> 05:04.360
You're so kind, Young Lady.

05:05.360 --> 05:06.830
I was so confused

05:07.190 --> 05:08.830
that I nearly made a terrible mistake.

05:10.070 --> 05:12.190
Not only did you not scold me,

05:12.360 --> 05:13.630
you've even treated me so kindly.

05:16.070 --> 05:19.190
This all started because of me.

05:20.390 --> 05:22.040
I wasn't careful enough that day.

05:23.040 --> 05:24.040
I didn't check

05:24.070 --> 05:25.630
the festive ornament I gave Jinqi.

05:25.816 --> 05:28.600
That's why you got dragged into this
through no fault of your own.

05:30.240 --> 05:31.240
Fortunately...

05:32.920 --> 05:34.120
Her name is Lanxiang, right?

05:35.830 --> 05:36.390
Yes.

05:36.750 --> 05:37.560
Lanxiang.

05:40.824 --> 05:42.456
Fortunately, Lanxiang was quick-witted.

05:42.680 --> 05:45.360
She knew to bring Nanny Wu
to get a flower ornament from you.

05:47.510 --> 05:48.310
But

05:49.240 --> 05:51.480
how did Lanxiang know my given name?

05:56.390 --> 05:57.480
I did.

05:58.120 --> 05:59.510
While we were chatting,

05:59.920 --> 06:01.630
I just happened to mention it.

06:05.040 --> 06:06.240
We're all girls.

06:06.536 --> 06:07.680
There's nothing shameful

06:07.750 --> 06:09.430
about my given name.

06:10.600 --> 06:11.750
Good thing you did.

06:15.120 --> 06:15.720
Here.

06:18.390 --> 06:19.120
Be careful.

06:22.120 --> 06:23.480
Get some proper rest today.

06:24.560 --> 06:26.560
When you're injured,
your vitality is weakened.

06:26.920 --> 06:29.120
Sleep is the best remedy.

07:12.190 --> 07:12.950
Young Lady,

07:13.384 --> 07:14.630
what are you sighing about?

07:21.920 --> 07:23.070
I was thinking of a story.

07:24.040 --> 07:25.160
There's a line in it.

07:26.830 --> 07:28.360
This man is like a swift falcon.

07:29.480 --> 07:30.680
If one strike is missed,

07:31.600 --> 07:33.240
he soars away without looking back.

07:46.160 --> 07:47.750
I long to be like that,

07:50.920 --> 07:52.270
but all I can do

07:53.510 --> 07:55.480
is long for it.

08:14.390 --> 08:15.240
Granny Du.

08:15.560 --> 08:18.190
Lanxiang only came home last night.

08:18.232 --> 08:20.450
It's rare for her to have
a day off from serving others.

08:20.480 --> 08:22.800
I wanted to let her sleep in.

08:23.000 --> 08:26.160
Now you're treating us like strangers.

08:27.070 --> 08:29.750
When Xiaolian's mother
came home from work,

08:30.360 --> 08:32.030
you knew she was catching up on sleep,

08:32.360 --> 08:34.790
so you always kept quiet
whatever you were doing.

08:35.510 --> 08:36.840
Thank you, Granny.

08:39.240 --> 08:42.120
Keep it down.

08:42.390 --> 08:43.630
Gently.

08:46.480 --> 08:47.030
Give it to me.

08:47.240 --> 08:48.030
I'll do it.

08:51.272 --> 08:52.720
Once I've gathered the materials

08:52.720 --> 08:54.070
and finished
Fourth Young Master's slingshot,

08:54.088 --> 08:55.640
I'll deliver it to the residence myself.

08:56.030 --> 08:57.240
Thank you.

09:01.670 --> 09:03.080
Gently.

09:06.390 --> 09:07.150
Take care.

09:35.140 --> 09:40.490
♪Time unfurls a long scroll♪

09:41.310 --> 09:46.280
♪Flowers bloom in
turn as twilight falls♪

09:47.360 --> 09:52.790
♪Through rise and fall, people meet
and part as they always do♪

09:53.390 --> 09:58.990
♪Each plant endures its own trials
before reaching shore♪

09:59.520 --> 10:02.420
♪Flowers drift with the ties of fate♪

10:02.620 --> 10:05.600
♪Plum blossoms bloom,
enduring the frost♪

10:06.080 --> 10:08.950
♪Yet their proud spirit fades
with wind and snow♪

10:08.960 --> 10:09.750
Father.

10:11.304 --> 10:12.200
You must be hungry.

10:12.320 --> 10:13.120
Come eat.

10:14.480 --> 10:15.630
It smells wonderful.

10:19.270 --> 10:20.440
There's something even better.

10:21.200 --> 10:21.790
Here.

10:25.480 --> 10:26.120
All right.

10:26.440 --> 10:27.080
Try it.

10:27.100 --> 10:28.760
Put on some more
of the chilblain ointment

10:28.776 --> 10:29.592
I gave you yesterday.

10:29.600 --> 10:31.000
I have to wash the dishes later.

10:31.000 --> 10:31.720
After I'm done...

10:31.720 --> 10:33.160
I'll wash the dishes after we eat.

10:34.270 --> 10:35.600
Go ahead and put it on.

10:35.910 --> 10:38.320
Otherwise, our daughter
won't be able to enjoy her meal.

10:39.480 --> 10:40.600
All right, I'll put it on.

10:40.600 --> 10:41.320
I'll put it on.

10:41.320 --> 10:48.390
♪I read every joy
and sorrow behind the curtain♪

10:51.480 --> 10:52.670
I can do it myself.

10:52.910 --> 10:53.870
I'll put it on for you.

11:00.720 --> 11:02.120
Just use a little.

11:10.150 --> 11:10.960
You know,

11:11.120 --> 11:12.670
this ointment Young Master gave you

11:13.240 --> 11:14.510
really works wonders.

11:15.320 --> 11:16.670
I put some on last night,

11:16.744 --> 11:17.670
and then went to sleep.

11:17.670 --> 11:18.360
Look.

11:18.840 --> 11:20.720
See? It's gone down a lot.

11:20.720 --> 11:22.600
It doesn't look as red now.

11:24.150 --> 11:24.840
All right.

11:25.510 --> 11:26.320
Put it away.

11:29.480 --> 11:30.510
All right, come on.

11:30.600 --> 11:31.240
Let's eat.

11:32.472 --> 11:33.440
Here, have a big piece.

11:36.840 --> 11:37.630
Here.

11:38.550 --> 11:39.360
Try this.

11:39.950 --> 11:42.230
♪Plum blossoms bloom,
enduring the frost♪

11:42.240 --> 11:43.360
Here, have a lean piece.

11:44.390 --> 11:45.200
Try it.

11:50.120 --> 11:50.910
It's delicious.

11:51.240 --> 11:52.320
Have another if you like it.

11:52.320 --> 11:55.050
♪Only orchids dwell in secluded places♪

11:55.440 --> 11:56.200
It's so good.

11:56.280 --> 11:57.192
The pork Mother made

11:57.272 --> 11:59.720
tastes even better than what the cooks
at the residence make.

12:02.056 --> 12:03.320
Why do you think Young Master

12:03.320 --> 12:05.630
went out of his way
to give you a day off?

12:06.320 --> 12:07.510
Isn't it obvious?

12:08.080 --> 12:09.790
Lanxiang must have
been clever and capable

12:09.840 --> 12:10.910
and handled things well.

12:11.200 --> 12:12.630
Young Master was pleased.

12:13.080 --> 12:14.270
Father's right.

12:14.870 --> 12:17.270
Look how happy you two are.

12:17.360 --> 12:18.000
You

12:18.000 --> 12:19.270
are becoming just like

12:19.480 --> 12:20.390
your father.

12:24.320 --> 12:25.200
Eat.

12:25.200 --> 12:25.630
Here.

12:25.630 --> 12:27.208
You should have more vegetables, too.

12:27.840 --> 12:28.270
Here.

12:42.120 --> 12:42.750
Come on.

12:42.870 --> 12:44.320
Have another lean piece.

12:45.910 --> 12:46.910
I'm already stuffed.

12:46.910 --> 12:48.120
I can't eat any more.

13:01.910 --> 13:04.120
I have something good to show you.

13:23.440 --> 13:24.360
This silver ingot...

13:24.910 --> 13:26.550
Why are its color and size

13:28.030 --> 13:29.440
different from the others?

13:29.550 --> 13:30.200
This...

13:30.232 --> 13:31.270
This isn't a silver ingot.

13:31.270 --> 13:32.360
It's gold.

13:35.150 --> 13:36.240
It really is gold?

13:39.080 --> 13:40.480
I've seen it at the shop.

13:40.480 --> 13:41.480
This is gold.

13:41.670 --> 13:42.480
Bite it.

13:42.670 --> 13:44.120
It's different from silver.

13:49.200 --> 13:50.390
Where did you get this?

13:53.480 --> 13:54.790
I did something important.

13:55.360 --> 13:58.030
You could say
I saved Young Master's marriage

13:58.080 --> 13:59.390
and the Lin family's reputation.

13:59.672 --> 14:01.512
First Madam gave it
to me as a special reward.

14:03.080 --> 14:04.390
Have you lost your senses?

14:06.000 --> 14:08.720
Does Lanxiang look like someone
who'd do anything improper?

14:08.870 --> 14:10.840
Even if we did something underhanded,

14:10.904 --> 14:12.648
Lanxiang would never do such a thing.

14:13.270 --> 14:13.670
I...

14:17.630 --> 14:18.080
I...

14:18.510 --> 14:18.960
I was...

14:19.000 --> 14:19.320
I was...

14:20.030 --> 14:21.080
I was just overwhelmed.

14:21.550 --> 14:22.870
Mother wasn't confused.

14:23.150 --> 14:25.000
The gold just left her stunned.

14:27.750 --> 14:28.200
This...

14:28.870 --> 14:29.440
This...

14:29.480 --> 14:31.030
How much is this worth?

14:32.360 --> 14:34.030
A... A hundred taels?

14:34.030 --> 14:36.790
Even after the exchange fee,

14:37.120 --> 14:39.080
it should still be worth
seventy or eighty taels.

14:44.080 --> 14:45.270
That's enough

14:45.390 --> 14:47.080
to buy freedom for all three of us.

14:48.270 --> 14:49.080
Really?

14:49.870 --> 14:51.080
Father's right.

14:51.510 --> 14:53.550
It is enough to buy our freedom.

14:56.240 --> 14:57.080
Just think...

14:57.870 --> 14:58.670
Just think,

14:58.870 --> 15:00.030
after all these years,

15:00.030 --> 15:01.750
we've worked ourselves to the bone,

15:02.150 --> 15:03.750
yet we could never save much.

15:05.200 --> 15:05.720
How...

15:06.000 --> 15:08.030
How can we suddenly have enough?

15:11.870 --> 15:13.390
Then let's buy our freedom.

15:13.390 --> 15:14.200
Once we do,

15:14.200 --> 15:15.960
Lanxiang won't even have to go back.

15:17.030 --> 15:18.240
I'll go find someone right now.

15:18.480 --> 15:18.910
Father.

15:19.030 --> 15:19.630
Father.

15:19.840 --> 15:20.390
Father.

15:23.150 --> 15:23.960
Mother.

15:24.320 --> 15:26.480
The time isn't right
to buy our freedom yet.

15:28.630 --> 15:28.960
What...

15:29.080 --> 15:30.030
What do you mean?

15:30.184 --> 15:31.870
Didn't we say once we had enough money,

15:31.896 --> 15:33.860
the three of us could
leave the household registry

15:33.870 --> 15:35.000
and buy our freedom together?

15:35.870 --> 15:37.960
I was thinking too simply before.

15:38.360 --> 15:39.390
At the going rate,

15:39.440 --> 15:41.720
buying freedom for the three of us

15:41.870 --> 15:43.750
would cost no more
than several dozen taels.

15:44.360 --> 15:46.600
But do Old Master and First Madam

15:46.840 --> 15:48.960
really care about
a few dozen taels of silver?

15:54.480 --> 15:55.600
That amount of money

15:57.270 --> 15:59.550
means nothing at all

15:59.790 --> 16:01.360
to them.

16:03.870 --> 16:05.480
The key to buying our freedom

16:05.480 --> 16:06.630
isn't money.

16:07.440 --> 16:08.870
It's First Madam's willingness.

16:10.390 --> 16:11.870
First Madam's willingness?

16:16.480 --> 16:18.390
We can't see it or touch it.

16:18.870 --> 16:19.910
It's not like money

16:20.150 --> 16:21.270
that we can go out and earn.

16:22.320 --> 16:23.510
We can't rush this.

16:24.056 --> 16:25.630
We must plan carefully before we act

16:26.080 --> 16:28.480
and wait for the right moment
to make our move.

16:29.360 --> 16:32.670
When that time comes, the three of us

16:32.670 --> 16:34.150
will surely be freed from servitude

16:34.480 --> 16:35.670
and become commoners.

16:37.670 --> 16:39.360
Lanxiang has grown up.

16:39.870 --> 16:42.390
You think everything through now.

16:43.270 --> 16:45.390
Your mother and I will follow your lead.

16:47.840 --> 16:49.120
Keep the gold safe.

16:50.080 --> 16:52.080
Once we leave Lin Residence,

16:52.240 --> 16:54.120
it'll give us the means to find a home,

16:54.440 --> 16:56.200
build a life, and start over.

17:30.968 --> 17:32.680
It took me forever to send the maids

17:32.680 --> 17:34.160
and the gatekeeper away.

17:34.480 --> 17:36.480
Don't make a sound later.

17:51.880 --> 17:53.030
Please, Xiuru.

17:53.070 --> 17:55.160
Come listen with me
about Xiuwan's marriage.

17:56.270 --> 17:57.070
Come on.

18:01.480 --> 18:03.590
Xiuwan's marriage to the Xie family

18:03.680 --> 18:04.960
is settled, isn't it?

18:05.830 --> 18:08.510
Ever since they met
on the Festival of Man,

18:08.510 --> 18:10.880
Xie Zhao has been very pleased

18:10.880 --> 18:11.750
with our Lin family.

18:11.960 --> 18:12.640
And Xiuwan

18:12.790 --> 18:14.240
is also pleased with Xie Zhao.

18:14.960 --> 18:16.070
Whenever I ask her about it,

18:16.270 --> 18:18.200
she just blushes and smiles.

18:20.600 --> 18:22.152
I'm discussing with the matchmaker

18:22.184 --> 18:24.110
an auspicious date
for the betrothal gifts.

18:24.720 --> 18:28.270
The marriage proposal, betrothal gifts,
bride-price, then the wedding.

18:30.680 --> 18:31.400
Who knows?

18:31.400 --> 18:33.240
Xiuwan may
be married off this very year.

18:33.400 --> 18:34.590
Most likely.

18:35.070 --> 18:37.160
I think at the latest,

18:37.160 --> 18:38.750
it'll be in the first half of next year.

18:38.750 --> 18:39.880
The first half?

18:40.110 --> 18:40.960
So soon?

18:42.830 --> 18:44.790
I can't believe Xiuwan's marriage

18:44.790 --> 18:45.590
is really settled.

18:45.960 --> 18:49.310
I'm both happy and sad.

18:50.240 --> 18:51.750
That's what it's like being a mother.

18:52.270 --> 18:53.830
When there's no marriage in sight,

18:53.880 --> 18:55.270
you're beside yourself with worry.

18:55.960 --> 18:57.350
Once a match is settled,

18:57.550 --> 18:59.750
you still can't stop worrying,

19:00.790 --> 19:02.920
wondering what their
married life will be like.

19:04.590 --> 19:05.400
Shunhua,

19:05.750 --> 19:06.830
you don't need to worry

19:06.830 --> 19:08.110
about Jinqi's marriage, either.

19:08.270 --> 19:09.110
Our Jinqi

19:09.310 --> 19:11.440
stands out in character,

19:11.440 --> 19:12.920
looks, and ability.

19:13.240 --> 19:14.350
At such a young age,

19:14.350 --> 19:16.960
he's already a Fourth-Rank
assistant commander.

19:17.550 --> 19:19.480
Even though Zhao
delayed him for several years,

19:19.680 --> 19:20.960
it won't hold him back.

19:21.310 --> 19:22.110
We'll certainly

19:22.350 --> 19:24.240
find him an excellent match.

19:25.256 --> 19:27.350
Why are you standing outside
instead of going in?

19:38.440 --> 19:39.750
It's almost the second month,

19:39.848 --> 19:42.088
but there's been
a cold snap these past few days.

19:42.160 --> 19:43.590
Don't catch a chill.

19:48.328 --> 19:49.990
First Madam
wants you all to come inside.

19:50.050 --> 19:51.288
Be careful not to catch a cold.

19:51.350 --> 19:53.240
We thought Jinqi was inside,

19:53.550 --> 19:55.960
so we wanted to hide beneath the window

19:55.960 --> 19:57.000
and give him a scare.

19:57.768 --> 19:59.510
My brother came over early this morning

19:59.510 --> 20:00.550
in a great hurry.

20:00.616 --> 20:02.880
He said there was an urgent matter
at the military camp,

20:02.960 --> 20:05.200
and then took Jinqi with him.

20:10.110 --> 20:11.110
I'd say

20:11.160 --> 20:13.032
it'll be quite
a while before they return.

20:20.830 --> 20:21.270
Come out!

20:21.270 --> 20:22.480
- Lin Jinqi, come out!
- Lin Jinqi, come out!

20:22.510 --> 20:23.980
(Jinling Shence Garrison)
Lin Jinqi, come out!

20:26.640 --> 20:27.480
Back up!

20:27.750 --> 20:28.640
Back up!

20:28.640 --> 20:29.440
Go back at once!

20:29.880 --> 20:30.640
Back up now!

20:30.640 --> 20:31.590
Don't cause trouble!

20:31.590 --> 20:32.720
Cause trouble?

20:32.808 --> 20:35.192
Do you all want a beating
with military rods?

20:37.336 --> 20:38.248
(Sun Yong, Chief Banner Officer)

20:38.320 --> 20:40.744
(of the Shence Garrison)
Tell that heartless Lin Jinqi to come!

20:40.960 --> 20:42.960
He must give us an explanation today!

20:43.110 --> 20:44.730
Our fellow soldiers were alive and well.

20:44.750 --> 20:46.550
They can't just die
without us knowing why!

20:46.584 --> 20:47.160
That's right!

20:47.160 --> 20:50.510
- Punish Lin Jinqi severely!
- Punish Lin Jinqi severely!

20:50.720 --> 20:52.830
If we don't get
a clear explanation today,

20:53.070 --> 20:55.160
Lin Jinqi won't leave here alive!

20:55.224 --> 20:56.510
- That's right!
- That's right!

20:59.860 --> 21:01.128
Before the Chinese New Year,

21:01.176 --> 21:03.390
when the soldiers
received the padded coats you issued,

21:03.400 --> 21:05.100
some already felt
they weren't warm enough.

21:05.960 --> 21:07.960
Then this recent cold snap hit,
and soldiers

21:08.024 --> 21:09.480
(Liang Yu)
at the military camp began falling ill

21:09.550 --> 21:11.630
(Third-Rank Commander)
with colds one after another.

21:11.720 --> 21:13.496
(of the Shence Garrison)
Some even died.

21:13.576 --> 21:14.824
Only then did we discover

21:15.070 --> 21:16.510
that the padded coats were filled

21:16.640 --> 21:18.960
entirely with old, moldy cotton,
and some

21:19.096 --> 21:21.848
were even stuffed with reed fluff
that provided no warmth at all.

21:22.590 --> 21:23.350
After inspection,

21:24.640 --> 21:27.880
four or five out
of every ten were like this.

21:28.984 --> 21:32.056
When we first received the padded coats
from the Ministry of Revenue,

21:33.070 --> 21:34.480
I had people inspect samples.

21:35.352 --> 21:37.624
Every one they checked
contained high-quality cotton.

21:40.400 --> 21:41.200
I never expected

21:42.160 --> 21:44.070
so many inferior ones to be mixed in.

21:47.830 --> 21:48.960
I failed in my duty.

21:49.384 --> 21:51.480
There were five
or six thousand padded coats.

21:51.640 --> 21:54.232
You couldn't possibly have cut
every one open to inspect it.

21:55.830 --> 21:57.310
I know you're innocent.

21:58.790 --> 22:00.160
But rumors are spreading

22:02.552 --> 22:05.310
that you colluded with unscrupulous
merchants and took bribes,

22:05.416 --> 22:07.880
passing off inferior goods
as quality ones and causing deaths.

22:08.830 --> 22:09.590
This matter

22:09.830 --> 22:12.790
was handled by you
from beginning to end.

22:14.750 --> 22:16.880
The higher-ups wanted
to punish you severely.

22:17.440 --> 22:18.640
I argued your case,

22:19.240 --> 22:21.510
and managed to stop them
from convicting you outright.

22:21.688 --> 22:23.912
For now, you've only
been suspended from duty.

22:26.030 --> 22:26.960
Thank you, Commander.

22:28.920 --> 22:30.184
You heard them outside.

22:31.350 --> 22:32.640
Go home and lie low for now.

22:32.792 --> 22:34.728
I've already ordered
a thorough investigation.

22:35.590 --> 22:36.720
I will clear your name.

22:41.000 --> 22:41.880
I'll take my leave.

22:47.200 --> 22:48.000
Back!

22:48.590 --> 22:49.480
Everyone, back!

22:52.680 --> 22:53.550
Everyone, back!

22:56.640 --> 22:58.160
Or you'll be killed on the spot!

23:16.720 --> 23:17.510
Lin Jinqi.

23:19.750 --> 23:22.550
This is the padded coat
you issued us to keep out the cold.

23:24.550 --> 23:25.750
Two of our fellow soldiers

23:26.880 --> 23:29.030
caught a cold and died.

23:30.350 --> 23:32.110
As men,

23:32.750 --> 23:34.920
even if we die on the battlefield,

23:35.510 --> 23:37.160
we'd be giving
our lives for our country!

23:39.310 --> 23:40.480
But they

23:41.510 --> 23:44.960
fell ill from the cold and died
in their own barracks!

23:58.480 --> 24:00.350
You high-ranking officials

24:01.270 --> 24:03.070
are truly heartless.

24:04.310 --> 24:06.400
You wear your fur coats,

24:07.550 --> 24:09.310
yet you even embezzle and skimp on

24:09.350 --> 24:10.720
the padded coats issued to us!

24:15.070 --> 24:16.000
Back!

24:16.830 --> 24:18.000
Everyone, back!

24:31.070 --> 24:31.960
Brothers,

24:33.720 --> 24:34.510
I, Lin Jinqi,

24:35.480 --> 24:37.200
have also been wounded
on the battlefield,

24:38.400 --> 24:39.350
shed blood,

24:40.720 --> 24:41.720
saved my brothers,

24:43.310 --> 24:44.400
and been saved by them.

24:45.720 --> 24:46.440
Here.

24:48.000 --> 24:48.790
Here!

24:50.480 --> 24:52.070
I was slashed by the Wo pirates.

24:56.880 --> 24:57.790
And here,

24:58.840 --> 25:01.048
I was struck
by a Wo pirate's blade, too!

25:07.510 --> 25:09.590
If not for the brothers
who fought beside me,

25:11.350 --> 25:12.550
I, Lin Jinqi,

25:13.680 --> 25:15.510
would have long
since been nothing but bones.

25:16.640 --> 25:18.968
What I despise most
are those who betray their brothers

25:19.720 --> 25:21.350
and stab them in the back!

25:23.240 --> 25:24.400
Your grief

25:25.640 --> 25:26.400
and anger,

25:28.480 --> 25:30.030
I feel them as deeply as you do.

25:35.720 --> 25:37.110
With Heaven above

25:38.400 --> 25:39.680
and Earth below as my witnesses,

25:41.110 --> 25:44.030
I, Lin Jinqi, will never let this matter

25:44.200 --> 25:45.790
pass without the truth coming to light!

25:47.000 --> 25:48.550
I will give everyone

25:48.790 --> 25:50.550
a full and clear explanation!

25:51.880 --> 25:52.790
Otherwise,

25:54.750 --> 25:56.830
may I die beneath a hail of blades

25:57.880 --> 25:59.310
and meet a terrible end.

26:08.440 --> 26:15.120
♪Every word carries countless thoughts♪

26:15.980 --> 26:18.800
♪The encounters of half a lifetime♪

26:20.400 --> 26:21.480
Lin Jinqi.

26:25.310 --> 26:27.070
We'll be waiting for your explanation.

26:27.736 --> 26:29.496
Otherwise, we won't
need Heaven to do it.

26:30.160 --> 26:32.550
We'll cut you down ourselves!

26:32.920 --> 26:34.110
Cut him down!

26:36.640 --> 26:37.880
May you die a terrible death!

26:37.880 --> 26:39.352
Pay with your life for our brothers!

26:39.450 --> 26:43.060
♪With my own hands and heart♪

26:43.110 --> 26:44.200
Are you even human?

26:44.280 --> 26:45.450
May you die a terrible death!

26:47.400 --> 26:57.350
♪Through countless lines of ink,
I question the past♪

27:05.528 --> 27:06.750
We're getting off early today.

27:06.888 --> 27:08.872
Let's go to Liufeng House
for a couple of drinks.

27:09.200 --> 27:09.880
Sounds good.

27:10.790 --> 27:11.440
Let's go.

27:25.240 --> 27:27.030
Lin Jinqi, what are you trying to do?

27:32.110 --> 27:35.510
The padded coats issued to Shence
Garrison before the Chinese New Year.

27:36.400 --> 27:37.310
These padded coats

27:38.400 --> 27:40.000
have already cost two men their lives.

27:42.400 --> 27:43.200
Registrar Dai,

27:44.350 --> 27:45.400
I want an explanation.

27:51.400 --> 27:52.200
Fengtai,

27:53.310 --> 27:55.640
I explained everything
clearly to you back then.

27:55.960 --> 27:57.440
It had been snowing heavily for days.

27:57.816 --> 28:00.640
The winter clothing granted
by the court was held up on the road

28:00.904 --> 28:02.070
and couldn't get through.

28:02.960 --> 28:04.310
But you couldn't wait.

28:06.030 --> 28:07.030
I had no choice

28:07.310 --> 28:08.550
but to ask around everywhere.

28:09.480 --> 28:10.750
After much persuasion,

28:11.110 --> 28:11.960
I finally found

28:11.960 --> 28:13.550
a merchant willing to supply the goods.

28:14.110 --> 28:14.960
All our colleagues

28:15.440 --> 28:17.480
can vouch for me on this.

28:17.790 --> 28:18.440
Yes.

28:18.680 --> 28:19.640
We can vouch for him.

28:19.640 --> 28:20.904
That's exactly what happened.

28:21.480 --> 28:23.270
You met that merchant,

28:23.480 --> 28:24.790
Lu Dalang, yourself.

28:26.000 --> 28:28.550
You also agreed to the arrangement.

28:29.030 --> 28:30.200
After the goods arrived,

28:30.200 --> 28:32.690
the Ministry of Revenue
inspected them according to procedure.

28:33.160 --> 28:35.030
From inspection to storage

28:35.096 --> 28:36.408
and then to release from storage,

28:36.590 --> 28:38.510
each step was signed and recorded.

28:40.312 --> 28:42.030
The account books can verify everything.

28:42.904 --> 28:45.736
(Released from Warehouse Yi Today)
When that batch of padded coats left,

28:45.784 --> 28:47.180
they all met the required standards.

28:47.200 --> 28:48.990
(Lin Jinqi, Assistant Commander)
So why did they turn into

28:49.032 --> 28:51.336
inferior padded coats
after reaching the Shence Garrison?

28:51.680 --> 28:55.310
Fengtai, you'd better
investigate this thoroughly.

28:59.350 --> 29:01.440
I won't just investigate this matter.

29:03.000 --> 29:04.750
I'll get to the bottom of it

29:05.550 --> 29:07.400
and find out exactly

29:08.200 --> 29:09.550
what happened.

29:10.880 --> 29:12.030
No matter who it was,

29:14.000 --> 29:15.400
if they had a hand in this,

29:16.070 --> 29:17.240
they won't get away.

29:20.808 --> 29:21.784
I went to the residence

29:21.832 --> 29:23.590
of that merchant, Lu Dalang,
to investigate.

29:23.600 --> 29:26.190
Lu Dalang's home caught fire
during Chinese New Year's firecrackers.

29:26.200 --> 29:28.890
Fortunately, it was put out in time
and didn't spread to the neighbors.

29:29.200 --> 29:30.030
After the fire,

29:30.040 --> 29:32.020
Lu Dalang said
he was going to stay with relatives

29:32.030 --> 29:33.400
and left Jinling with his family.

29:33.400 --> 29:34.990
No one has known his whereabouts since.

29:35.310 --> 29:37.110
More than twenty days have passed now.

29:37.640 --> 29:38.830
Finding him again

29:39.256 --> 29:40.536
will probably take some effort.

29:43.200 --> 29:44.200
What a coincidence.

29:45.680 --> 29:46.830
He just happened to leave.

29:55.580 --> 29:57.660
(Ten Days Later)

30:02.270 --> 30:03.350
Leave this side to me.

30:03.440 --> 30:04.310
You go over there.

30:21.200 --> 30:21.720
Young Master.

30:22.110 --> 30:23.070
Young Lady Du is here.

30:31.350 --> 30:32.110
Jinqi.

30:34.960 --> 30:37.440
Are you playing against yourself?

30:39.336 --> 30:40.510
I had nothing else to do,

30:40.632 --> 30:41.896
so I'm just passing the time.

30:43.680 --> 30:44.920
I have nothing to do, either.

30:45.400 --> 30:46.880
If you don't mind, Jinqi,

30:47.160 --> 30:49.720
why don't I play a game with you?

31:01.512 --> 31:03.200
You're an excellent player, Cuique.

31:03.960 --> 31:06.480
But I've been playing
for quite a while today.

31:06.750 --> 31:07.830
I'm feeling a little tired

31:07.960 --> 31:08.880
and would like to rest.

31:09.480 --> 31:10.270
Maybe next time.

31:14.200 --> 31:17.000
Are you upset
about being suspended, Jinqi?

31:20.264 --> 31:23.000
My brother told me what happened
with the Shence Garrison.

31:24.350 --> 31:27.590
I firmly believe you're innocent, Jinqi.

31:28.880 --> 31:30.310
No matter how others see you,

31:30.310 --> 31:32.568
what they say about you,
or how they slander you, I...

31:37.030 --> 31:37.790
My brother and I

31:38.200 --> 31:39.510
both believe in you, Jinqi.

31:41.030 --> 31:43.110
The truth will surely come to light

31:43.270 --> 31:44.600
and everything will be made clear.

31:48.070 --> 31:50.640
I also believe
the truth will come to light

31:50.712 --> 31:52.200
and everything will be made clear.

31:54.000 --> 31:55.440
Did you come to see me today

31:56.110 --> 31:57.240
for something in particular?

32:03.590 --> 32:04.920
I was just a little worried,

32:05.400 --> 32:06.590
so I came to see you.

32:07.000 --> 32:09.070
I thought if something
was troubling you,

32:09.200 --> 32:11.110
I could keep you company
and talk with you.

32:16.400 --> 32:17.400
Since you're tired,

32:17.750 --> 32:18.880
you should get some rest.

32:19.550 --> 32:21.070
I won't disturb you any longer.

32:21.160 --> 32:21.920
I'll be going now.

32:22.440 --> 32:23.440
Take care, Cuique.

32:50.350 --> 32:51.200
Aunt Lingxiao.

32:54.310 --> 32:55.160
Young Lady Du.

32:55.400 --> 32:56.440
Jinqi.

32:57.270 --> 32:58.440
Jinqi.

33:03.960 --> 33:04.550
Xiaolian,

33:07.070 --> 33:08.160
you don't come by often.

33:08.440 --> 33:09.920
Go spend some time with the girls.

33:10.160 --> 33:11.440
I can go back by myself.

33:13.400 --> 33:14.270
Thank you, Young Lady.

33:17.400 --> 33:18.200
Jinqi,

33:18.880 --> 33:20.640
you have to help Xiuwan.

33:21.640 --> 33:23.270
If word of this gets out,

33:23.480 --> 33:25.720
how is she supposed
to face people in the future?

33:27.350 --> 33:27.960
Aunt Lingxiao,

33:28.160 --> 33:29.160
don't worry just yet.

33:29.270 --> 33:30.408
Sit down and tell me slowly.

33:30.510 --> 33:31.680
What exactly happened?

33:33.440 --> 33:35.350
Xiuwan's marriage to the Xie family

33:36.110 --> 33:38.000
was practically settled.

33:38.010 --> 33:40.120
But the Xie family
has suddenly changed their minds,

33:40.136 --> 33:41.896
claiming their
birth dates are incompatible.

33:42.070 --> 33:43.440
If word gets out,

33:43.960 --> 33:45.270
people will think our Xiuwan

33:45.270 --> 33:46.790
has something wrong with her.

33:48.590 --> 33:49.270
Aunt Lingxiao,

33:49.848 --> 33:50.510
the Xie...

33:50.510 --> 33:51.480
Jinqi,

33:52.110 --> 33:53.160
your second uncle

33:54.240 --> 33:56.856
spends his days following
Taoist priests and drawing talismans.

33:57.030 --> 33:58.510
He's not someone we can rely on.

33:58.880 --> 34:00.070
Since you happen to be free,

34:00.680 --> 34:02.200
hurry over to the Xie family

34:02.550 --> 34:03.270
and find out

34:03.270 --> 34:04.680
what exactly is going on.

34:04.680 --> 34:07.048
Why would a perfectly
good marriage suddenly fall through?

34:07.270 --> 34:08.360
What exactly is

34:08.670 --> 34:10.510
wrong with our Xiuwan?

34:13.070 --> 34:13.880
Aunt Lingxiao,

34:14.536 --> 34:16.456
the Xie family
doesn't want this marriage

34:16.472 --> 34:18.440
not because there's
anything wrong with Xiuwan.

34:18.760 --> 34:19.630
It's because of me.

34:21.110 --> 34:22.320
I've dragged Xiuwan into this.

34:23.190 --> 34:23.480
You...

34:24.710 --> 34:26.590
What do you mean by that?

34:28.760 --> 34:29.710
First Madam.

34:33.760 --> 34:34.510
Shunhua.

34:35.360 --> 34:36.400
Xiuwan...

34:40.440 --> 34:41.360
There's something

34:41.630 --> 34:43.336
I haven't had a chance to tell you yet.

34:44.030 --> 34:44.510
Come.

34:46.456 --> 34:48.360
Something happened
at the Shence Garrison.

34:48.960 --> 34:51.710
Jinqi was falsely accused
of taking bribes,

34:51.800 --> 34:53.272
and shortchanging the soldiers.

34:53.360 --> 34:55.352
He's already
been suspended by his superior.

34:56.550 --> 34:59.630
And with his previous separation
from the Zhao family,

34:59.920 --> 35:01.000
I've been thinking

35:01.630 --> 35:04.190
the Xie family only backed out

35:04.280 --> 35:06.280
because our family ran into trouble.

35:08.630 --> 35:09.440
So

35:09.840 --> 35:11.000
the Xie family

35:11.960 --> 35:14.440
believes Jinqi will
be suppressed by the Zhao family

35:14.710 --> 35:16.840
and never rise again.

35:16.984 --> 35:18.888
That's why they're using the birth dates

35:19.230 --> 35:21.000
to find fault with Xiuwan?

35:22.760 --> 35:24.030
That must be it.

35:28.070 --> 35:29.400
I've dragged Xiuwan into this.

35:34.184 --> 35:36.030
And the Xie family
is always claiming to be

35:36.030 --> 35:37.190
a distinguished family?

35:38.440 --> 35:39.230
As if!

35:42.590 --> 35:43.480
Jinqi,

35:44.000 --> 35:45.670
none of this is your fault.

35:46.840 --> 35:48.480
Think about it. In a person's lifetime,

35:48.936 --> 35:50.760
how could everything
possibly go smoothly

35:50.760 --> 35:52.150
without any setbacks?

35:53.480 --> 35:55.960
The Xie family is so eager
to curry favor with the powerful.

35:57.760 --> 36:00.030
If I really married
Xiuwan into their family,

36:02.920 --> 36:05.550
wouldn't I be pushing her
into a living hell?

36:10.190 --> 36:12.760
Those snobs who look down on others.

36:15.320 --> 36:16.920
If they don't want this marriage,

36:18.024 --> 36:20.000
then we won't marry
into their family either.

36:20.760 --> 36:21.840
We won't!

36:24.264 --> 36:25.510
Don't worry, Aunt Lingxiao.

36:26.190 --> 36:27.510
I'll visit the Xie family shortly

36:27.800 --> 36:29.280
and make things clear with them.

36:29.550 --> 36:31.320
I won't let a single disparaging word

36:31.360 --> 36:32.264
be said about Xiuwan.

36:35.400 --> 36:36.320
You unfilial son!

36:37.710 --> 36:40.150
You wretched fool!
You've caused such a huge mess,

36:40.150 --> 36:42.190
yet you're hiding at home
as if nothing happened!

36:42.584 --> 36:44.070
Instead of going around seeking help,

36:44.070 --> 36:46.380
asking people to use
their connections and plead your case,

36:46.392 --> 36:48.150
you still have the leisure
to play chess!

36:48.710 --> 36:49.400
Changzheng.

36:51.280 --> 36:53.000
Jinqi has a plan of his own.

36:53.190 --> 36:54.590
We don't need to worry about him.

36:55.000 --> 36:56.150
A plan?

36:57.576 --> 36:58.808
Would someone with a plan

36:59.320 --> 37:00.880
have offended the Zhao family?

37:01.280 --> 37:03.230
I told you not to separate from Zhao,

37:03.230 --> 37:04.330
but you refused to listen.

37:04.340 --> 37:05.150
And look at you now.

37:05.360 --> 37:06.664
The moment something happened,

37:06.670 --> 37:08.070
your superior suspended you.

37:08.110 --> 37:08.880
Mark my words.

37:08.880 --> 37:09.710
Within days,

37:09.800 --> 37:11.336
you'll be dismissed and investigated,

37:11.360 --> 37:12.520
and then thrown in prison!

37:12.590 --> 37:14.110
What nonsense are you talking about?

37:14.920 --> 37:16.280
Jinqi was falsely accused.

37:16.440 --> 37:18.330
He didn't embezzle anything
or take any bribes.

37:18.440 --> 37:20.744
How could he possibly
be dismissed and imprisoned?

37:21.030 --> 37:23.550
You've offended Grand Secretary Zhao.

37:23.630 --> 37:26.030
Do you think they care
whether you're innocent?

37:26.728 --> 37:28.990
Do you think he became
a Fourth-Rank assistant commander

37:29.000 --> 37:30.230
because he's so capable?

37:30.344 --> 37:32.670
It's because he's
the Grand Secretary's grandson-in-law.

37:32.670 --> 37:34.232
He had someone powerful backing him!

37:35.320 --> 37:36.510
Now Grand Secretary Zhao

37:36.760 --> 37:39.710
is on the verge
of becoming Grand Secretary-in-Chief,

37:40.110 --> 37:43.510
yet he's parted ways
with the Zhao family.

37:43.670 --> 37:46.710
He's practically asking for trouble.

37:46.840 --> 37:48.920
If they don't frame him,
who else would they frame?

37:49.030 --> 37:50.150
As I see it,

37:50.480 --> 37:52.230
he should just wait
to be thrown in prison.

37:53.230 --> 37:54.280
Lin Changzheng!

37:54.400 --> 37:56.110
You truly are a vulgar man.

37:58.150 --> 38:01.510
Utterly vulgar and thoroughly repulsive.

38:01.510 --> 38:03.380
(Lin Changmin, Lin Jinqi's Second Uncle)

38:04.880 --> 38:05.800
Lin Changmin.

38:06.840 --> 38:09.480
Who are you calling utterly vulgar
and thoroughly repulsive?

38:09.670 --> 38:10.480
You.

38:11.230 --> 38:12.030
Changzheng,

38:12.400 --> 38:14.280
you've studied for decades,

38:14.400 --> 38:16.480
yet all you think
about is rank and wealth.

38:16.584 --> 38:18.870
You spend every day scheming
and scrambling for advantage,

38:18.880 --> 38:21.000
thinking only of how to flatter

38:21.000 --> 38:22.840
those high-ranking officials.

38:24.670 --> 38:25.480
Changzheng,

38:25.592 --> 38:27.400
since you admire
Grand Secretary Zhao so much,

38:27.590 --> 38:29.230
why make your own son

38:29.230 --> 38:30.960
the Grand Secretary's grandson-in-law?

38:31.400 --> 38:33.510
Why don't you
become his son-in-law yourself?

38:35.000 --> 38:35.710
Changmin!

38:35.880 --> 38:37.590
I've put up with you for long enough.

38:37.960 --> 38:39.280
No one stops me today!

38:39.440 --> 38:40.320
No one stops me!

38:40.670 --> 38:42.480
I'm going to settle this with you!

38:42.880 --> 38:44.000
Changzheng, wait.

38:46.190 --> 38:48.110
You said you've put up
with me for a long time?

38:48.360 --> 38:49.030
That's right!

38:49.432 --> 38:51.280
I cultivate my mind
and character every day,

38:51.280 --> 38:52.270
meditating on the Taoist,

38:52.280 --> 38:55.030
and I've long since risen
above this mundane world.

38:55.590 --> 38:56.760
I would never

38:56.760 --> 38:58.510
associate with a vulgar man like you.

38:58.616 --> 38:59.920
When have I ever provoked him?

38:59.920 --> 39:01.550
Have I ever provoked him? Unbelievable.

39:02.824 --> 39:04.400
If I don't teach you a lesson today,

39:04.400 --> 39:05.320
I'm not your brother!

39:05.480 --> 39:05.840
I...

39:06.150 --> 39:06.670
I...

39:07.896 --> 39:09.500
If you've got the nerve, stop hiding!

39:09.510 --> 39:11.150
I hide because I've got the nerve.

39:11.160 --> 39:12.550
Fine. Keep hiding.

39:12.550 --> 39:13.800
Changzheng, can't you calm down?

39:13.800 --> 39:15.070
Let's see where you can hide!

39:15.280 --> 39:16.880
Then I'll run this way.

39:18.550 --> 39:19.840
I'll teach you a lesson!

39:23.550 --> 39:24.880
Why won't this door open?

39:24.880 --> 39:25.550
I'll smash you!

39:25.550 --> 39:26.280
Master.

39:27.096 --> 39:29.288
Those are Yunzi stones
bestowed by Old Master.

39:46.480 --> 39:48.150
They're merely worldly possessions.

39:48.760 --> 39:49.550
Changzheng,

39:49.880 --> 39:51.230
smash them if you wish.

39:51.590 --> 39:52.880
Follow your heart.

39:53.710 --> 39:55.400
That's what makes a true gentleman.

39:55.960 --> 39:56.590
Thank you.

39:58.190 --> 39:58.590
Changmin.

39:58.590 --> 39:59.710
You're driving me mad!

40:01.280 --> 40:02.400
I'll get you!

40:03.760 --> 40:04.550
Let go of me!

40:05.920 --> 40:06.710
Don't you leave!

40:13.840 --> 40:14.710
Lin Changmin!

40:14.920 --> 40:15.800
Lin Changmin!

40:16.030 --> 40:16.920
I'm over here.

40:17.110 --> 40:18.230
You stop right there!

40:18.590 --> 40:20.320
Why are you still at it, Changzheng?

40:20.510 --> 40:22.030
You've gone too far!

40:27.760 --> 40:28.710
Jinqi,

40:30.480 --> 40:31.880
your second uncle is just like that.

40:32.360 --> 40:34.320
Don't take what he said to heart.

40:35.590 --> 40:36.400
Aunt Lingxiao,

40:37.000 --> 40:39.440
don't worry too much
about Xiuwan's marriage.

40:39.544 --> 40:41.550
I'll settle my own affairs
as soon as possible.

40:43.110 --> 40:43.920
It's fine.

40:44.880 --> 40:46.190
It's fine.

40:48.070 --> 40:49.360
Come sit with me.

40:50.360 --> 40:51.510
We can have a chat.

41:13.960 --> 41:14.760
Young Master.

41:16.510 --> 41:17.070
How did it go?

41:17.280 --> 41:18.230
Did you find anything?

41:19.840 --> 41:22.440
Nanke and I asked everyone along both

41:22.440 --> 41:23.760
the waterways and overland routes

41:23.760 --> 41:24.710
out of Jinling.

41:24.856 --> 41:27.190
No one heard anything
about Lu Dalang leaving Jinling.

41:28.320 --> 41:30.510
A grown man
couldn't simply vanish into thin air.

41:32.150 --> 41:32.840
Perhaps

41:33.752 --> 41:35.590
Lu Dalang
deliberately laid a false trail.

41:36.760 --> 41:38.280
It looked as though he'd left Jinling,

41:39.280 --> 41:41.630
but he's actually
still somewhere in Jinling City.

41:42.150 --> 41:43.070
That must be it.

41:43.800 --> 41:44.880
Otherwise, Nanke and I

41:44.920 --> 41:47.016
couldn't have come up
completely empty-handed.

41:47.400 --> 41:49.710
Even if Lu Dalang
is hiding somewhere in Jinling City,

41:50.280 --> 41:52.040
it'll still be
very difficult to find him.

41:53.150 --> 41:53.960
That's right.

41:54.880 --> 41:56.000
Jinling City is enormous.

41:56.440 --> 41:58.230
He could hole up in any obscure corner,

41:58.600 --> 42:00.280
and even if we searched the entire city,

42:00.280 --> 42:01.400
we still might not find him.

42:02.360 --> 42:05.880
Besides, you're
suspended now, Young Master,

42:05.928 --> 42:08.152
and the Zhao family
is making things difficult for us.

42:08.190 --> 42:09.630
We simply don't have the means

42:10.760 --> 42:12.440
to search every corner of Jinling City.

42:15.710 --> 42:16.630
I have a lead.

42:35.800 --> 42:36.590
Young Master,

42:36.670 --> 42:37.880
I think I have a lead.

42:39.190 --> 42:40.000
You mean

42:40.504 --> 42:42.480
you have a lead
that could help us find Lu Dalang?

42:44.670 --> 42:45.550
I can't find him,

42:46.480 --> 42:48.070
but perhaps I can find

42:48.070 --> 42:49.896
the women who made those padded coats.

43:00.150 --> 43:00.710
How?

43:05.020 --> 43:07.940
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

43:10.552 --> 43:12.520
Young Master,
you've lived a life of privilege.

43:12.632 --> 43:14.808
You don't know that for people
at the bottom like us,

43:15.070 --> 43:16.550
sometimes just staying alive

43:17.030 --> 43:18.590
takes everything we have.

43:20.000 --> 43:21.400
If we want to rise above our station

43:21.400 --> 43:22.590
and live a little better,

43:23.190 --> 43:24.920
we may have to abandon our conscience

43:25.480 --> 43:26.590
and risk our lives.

43:28.536 --> 43:30.264
It's not that
I understand people so well.

43:30.840 --> 43:33.550
It's just like those reed down shoes.

43:33.752 --> 43:35.816
You've never
seen them before, Young Master,

43:36.110 --> 43:37.630
but we see them every day.

43:37.768 --> 43:39.464
There's nothing unusual about them.

43:57.741 --> 44:01.861
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

44:04.701 --> 44:09.221
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

44:10.501 --> 44:14.421
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

44:15.101 --> 44:17.861
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

44:18.581 --> 44:20.901
♪Though all the world may fade♪

44:20.901 --> 44:23.981
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

44:25.501 --> 44:29.741
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

44:32.661 --> 44:36.821
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

44:38.621 --> 44:42.181
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

44:42.181 --> 44:45.741
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

44:46.541 --> 44:52.221
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

44:52.581 --> 44:56.901
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

44:57.261 --> 45:00.221
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

45:00.221 --> 45:03.981
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

45:03.981 --> 45:06.861
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

45:06.861 --> 45:10.941
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

45:10.941 --> 45:14.301
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

45:14.301 --> 45:18.061
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

45:18.061 --> 45:22.061
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

45:22.821 --> 45:26.981
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

45:26.981 --> 45:30.421
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

45:30.421 --> 45:34.061
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

45:34.061 --> 45:36.941
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

45:36.941 --> 45:41.021
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

45:41.021 --> 45:44.381
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

45:44.381 --> 45:48.021
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

45:48.021 --> 45:55.821
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪
